# Signing material outside `android/`, which has its own rules for
# `key.properties`, `**/*.keystore` and `**/*.jks` - and is where CI writes
# both, so the release path was never exposed. These catch the keystore a
# maintainer makes by hand wherever they ran `keytool`.
*.jks
*.keystore

